**Exchange 1 – Submit Orders**

```json
{
  "orders": [
    {
      "symbol": "MEDI",
      "side": "buy",
      "quantity": 10,
      "type": "market"
    }
  ]
}
```

This order will close your current short position in MEDI at the best available ask price (99.76), neutralizing the position and locking in the small unrealized loss. No other trades are placed this cycle.
